# ── PERSONAL MEDIA — NEVER COMMIT ───────────────────────────────────────
# This project is a family album. No photograph, depth map or home video
# belongs in version control. These patterns are deliberately UNANCHORED so
# they match a directory of that name at ANY depth — the opposite of the
# .vercelignore rule, and on purpose: here, over-matching is the safe failure.
photos/
depth/
video/
work/
*.webp
follow-me.jpg

# The real manifest names real people and real years. The placeholder that
# ships as data/memories.json is force-added; anything else stays out.
memories.private.json

# ── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env*
.vercel/

# ── Local scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
